title: "Ostium ITSM: AI-assisted IT service management MVP"
abstract: "Open-source MVP of Ostium, an AI-assisted cloud IT service management (ITSM) and enterprise service management platform by SDLC Corp, with omnichannel intake, explainable AI triage with governance modes, a business-hours SLA engine, service catalog workflows, knowledge management, CMDB impact analysis and a REST API."
